{'symbol': 'HON', 'date': '2021-04-30 09:00:00', 'title': 'HONEYWELL ANNOUNCES TRANSFER OF STOCK EXCHANGE LISTING TO NASDAQ', 'text': 'CHARLOTTE, N.C., APRIL 30, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0HONEYWELL (NYSE: HON) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT WILL TRANSFER THE LISTING OF ITS COMMON STOCK AND LISTED BONDS FROM THE NEW YORK STOCK EXCHANGE TO THE NASDAQ STOCK MARKET ("NASDAQ").'}